msgctxt "192_Player"
msgid "(There's a manhole exit here... No need to lift up the heavy lid and get out of here.)"
msgstr "(Una salida de alcantarilla... No hace falta levantar la pesada tapa para salir de aquí)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
